{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And you shall overlay.</b> He mentioned a roof for this altar, but not so for the bronze altar. And because it is overlaid with gold, it is called the golden altar. So too 'the pure table' (Leviticus 24:6), like 'the pure lampstand' (ibid. 4)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:15.245059513Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}